# Change Management and Training Plan

## Stakeholders
- Procurement coordinators
- HSE reviewers
- Project controls
- Managers
- IT support teams

## Proposed Implementation

1. Identify affected stakeholders.
2. Conduct workflow demonstrations.
3. Deliver hands-on AI training.
4. Develop quick-reference guides.
5. Introduce a controlled pilot.
6. Gather user feedback.
7. Measure adoption and refine the solution.

## Adoption Metrics
- Training participation.
- User satisfaction.
- Workflow adoption.
- AI classification corrections.
- Outstanding support requests.

No actual adoption outcomes are claimed in this prototype.
